+/* Crash 2's widescreen scenery range (crash2_wide_slst.h). Live, so one launch
+ * can A/B it:
+ *   c2_slst               -> counters
+ *   c2_slst {"k":N}       -> camera-path nodes either side at 16:9, 0 = off
+ *                            (scaled by the live widescreen margin)
+ *   c2_slst {"reset":1}   -> zero the counters
+ * built = merged lists made (one per node); used = render calls that drew one;
+ * added = polygons the current one adds; added_max = the most so far;
+ * mismatch = the game's list was not the rebuilt list of its node (left
+ * alone); bad = SLST entries this could not rebuild; prim_skips = frames whose
+ * primitive buffer had too little room left (drawn as the game built them). */
